# Build-context filter for cloud.Dockerfile (BuildKit picks up <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Context = restaurant-vision/. Only contracts/, cloud/, web/, docs/compliance/ and one deploy
# script are needed.
*
!contracts/
!cloud/
!web/
!docs/compliance/
!deploy/scripts/compliance_pdfs.py
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite
**/*.db
**/.env
**/*.tsbuildinfo
